hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19308","Waki narrated to us: Sufyan narrated to us from Simak from Suwayd ibn Qays, he said: I and Makhramah al-Abdi brought garments from Hajar. He said: So the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, came to us and bargained with us for a pair of trousers, and with us were weighmen who weigh for a wage, so he said to the weighman: Weigh, and give extra."
"19309","Hajjaj narrated to us: Shubah narrated to us from Simak from Malik Abu Safwan ibn Umayrah, he said: I sold the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, a leg of a pair of trousers before the Hijrah, and he gave me extra."
